--TEST--
inside its class an owned enum is written by its bare name, so a bare `Status::` in a method body offers its cases, `rule:enums/class-scoped-enum`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Order {
    enum Status { Draft = 1, Paid = 2 }

    public function first(): int {
        return Status::<|>
    }
}
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
Draft = 1 enumMember
Paid = 2 enumMember
